    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384240/extras/fc67212fc82cef1fd12e03b69107d016.poster.avif?t=1737022901\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384240/extras/fc67212fc82cef1fd12e03b69107d016.webm?t=1737022901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384240/extras/fc67212fc82cef1fd12e03b69107d016.mp4?t=1737022901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hanzi Match&quot; is a match puzzle game. Select three same Chinese characters to them. Match all the characters to win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pronunciation will be played every time you click on the character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Endless puzzle levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa 200+ Chinese characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Click the character to play its pronunciation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Automatically get a new achievement every 60 seconds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384240/extras/a84c521459352ca77470a1d8e13e804d.avif?t=1737022901\" width=800 height=305 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384240/extras/fc67212fc82cef1fd12e03b69107d016.poster.avif?t=1737022901\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384240/extras/fc67212fc82cef1fd12e03b69107d016.webm?t=1737022901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384240/extras/fc67212fc82cef1fd12e03b69107d016.mp4?t=1737022901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hanzi Match&quot; is a match puzzle game. Select three same Chinese characters to them. Match all the characters to win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pronunciation will be played every time you click on the character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Endless puzzle levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa 200+ Chinese characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Click the character to play its pronunciation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25aa Automatically get a new achievement every 60 seconds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384240/extras/a84c521459352ca77470a1d8e13e804d.avif?t=1737022901\" width=800 height=305 /></span></p>",
